OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fcloudy in the west with occasional
OL,7,Frain and a chance of haar. A dry and
OL,8,Fbright evening in the east but turning
OL,9,Fcloudy overnight with showers
OL,10,Fdeveloping.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FShowers or longer spells of
OL,13,Frain in the west, heavy at times. Warm
OL,14,Fin the east with bright spells and a
OL,15,Ffew showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
